WEBVTT

00:14.681 --> 00:17.934
The sun… It's dusk!

00:19.060 --> 00:20.270
This can't be…

00:20.353 --> 00:22.897
It must have started at that moment!

00:23.398 --> 00:26.901
The priest has been executing his ability
since he was in the Shuttle!

00:26.985 --> 00:29.946
All things are moving
at an incredible speed!

00:30.029 --> 00:31.656
Everything in this world,

00:31.740 --> 00:36.327
not only man-made things,
but things in nature too!

00:36.411 --> 00:38.872
The sun is already down!

00:38.955 --> 00:41.958
Is this his completed ability?

00:44.794 --> 00:46.087
Where is he?

00:46.171 --> 00:47.672
Where did he go?

00:48.256 --> 00:51.384
I can stop time for five seconds at most.

00:51.468 --> 00:55.722
In just five seconds,
I must find him and finish him off.

00:56.306 --> 00:57.724
Time's up.

00:57.807 --> 00:59.309
Time will now start again…

01:00.560 --> 01:01.394
What?

01:01.478 --> 01:03.897
No way. He's using the tree's flexibility!

01:25.168 --> 01:28.254
I will part with this last remark.

01:28.338 --> 01:30.006
Time will accelerate.

01:30.965 --> 01:36.721
I did not obtain this power
to end your lives,

01:36.805 --> 01:40.058
nor does this ability promise me
supreme strength.

01:41.226 --> 01:46.689
This power's purpose is to guide
the human race towards true happiness.

01:47.190 --> 01:51.444
My new Stand, my new ability.

01:52.153 --> 01:54.072
I shall give it a name.

01:54.572 --> 01:56.491
Maiden Heaven!

03:27.832 --> 03:31.002
EPISODE 37: MAIDEN HEAVEN (2)

03:31.085 --> 03:34.839
You're being eliminated
for the future I envision.

03:35.340 --> 03:37.717
Your impending death

03:37.800 --> 03:43.139
is merely a sacrifice
for humanity to achieve happiness.

03:46.017 --> 03:47.185
Gun ghost!

03:49.270 --> 03:50.730
It's useless, Emporio.

03:50.813 --> 03:52.315
Shooting him won't do any good.

03:52.398 --> 03:53.816
No, Jolyne.

03:53.900 --> 03:55.860
I shot at the building near us!

03:56.569 --> 03:58.738
Ermes put her sticker on the bullet.

03:58.821 --> 04:01.115
The bullet is duplicated!

04:02.867 --> 04:04.035
Emporio, you…

04:04.911 --> 04:07.205
He's coming at us again!

04:07.288 --> 04:09.040
Hold on tight, everyone!

04:09.123 --> 04:11.542
No matter what, don't let go!

04:27.642 --> 04:30.186
It's him! He's chasing us on foot!

04:30.270 --> 04:33.898
My Stand's speed is excluded
from the time acceleration!

04:33.982 --> 04:35.650
He'll catch up in no time!

04:35.733 --> 04:39.737
Emporio, put a sticker on the next bullet
and shoot again!

04:40.488 --> 04:42.573
We have to reach the swamp,

04:43.157 --> 04:44.284
to the ocean!

04:44.367 --> 04:48.788
If we're at the ocean,
then we might have a chance!

04:51.499 --> 04:53.501
The priest caught up to us!

04:53.584 --> 04:55.628
He's getting ahead to stand in our way!

04:56.421 --> 04:59.257
Shoot another bullet,
and change our direction, Emporio!

04:59.841 --> 05:02.552
It's the ocean!
I see the rocks in the swamp!

05:02.635 --> 05:06.306
Aim the next shot at
those protruding rocks!

05:14.647 --> 05:16.482
He's coming for us again!

05:16.566 --> 05:17.734
He's simply too fast!

05:17.817 --> 05:23.114
Listen closely.
He's moving with accelerated time,

05:23.197 --> 05:24.907
but one Stand is all he's got!

05:24.991 --> 05:28.494
Plus, its combat strength
is above average at best!

05:29.829 --> 05:33.499
He can only attack one of us at a time.

05:33.583 --> 05:36.336
That's the key to our victory.

05:36.919 --> 05:43.593
Jotaro, I'll send you a signal
the moment I get attacked.

05:43.676 --> 05:47.889
Seize that opportunity to stop time
and finish him off!

05:48.473 --> 05:54.270
The moment his attack hits me,
that's when you stop the time.

05:55.855 --> 05:56.689
Do you understand?

05:57.273 --> 06:00.193
Don't do it before I'm hit,
it has to be after.

06:00.276 --> 06:02.111
It'll be a split of a second.

06:02.695 --> 06:04.197
You must be absolutely precise.

06:04.280 --> 06:06.365
Grab him and end his life.

06:06.449 --> 06:09.494
Our only chance is your Star Platinum!

06:10.203 --> 06:11.954
Wait a minute.

06:12.038 --> 06:13.498
We're doing what?

06:13.581 --> 06:16.751
I don't understand.

06:17.335 --> 06:19.462
Smart plan, Anastasia.

06:19.962 --> 06:24.175
Although he proclaimed
that you are his first target,

06:24.258 --> 06:25.802
that may not be the case.

06:27.011 --> 06:30.973
It would make most sense
if he targeted me first.

06:31.557 --> 06:35.186
No, I've already submerged Diver Drive
into your body,

06:35.269 --> 06:38.856
so that it can protect you
from the inside.

06:38.940 --> 06:40.817
You're not the only one.

06:40.900 --> 06:43.319
Jolyne, Emporio, and Ermes too.

06:43.402 --> 06:47.240
Diver Drive has submerged into everyone
given our close distance.

06:47.323 --> 06:50.243
In other words, no matter
who gets attacked first,

06:51.077 --> 06:54.497
Diver Drive will feel the damage.

06:54.580 --> 06:55.665
What?

06:55.748 --> 07:01.295
You will sense my signal
internally through Diver Drive.

07:01.379 --> 07:06.509
Remember, don't stop time
until after I'm hit.

07:07.135 --> 07:10.096
Anastasia, you're willing
to trade your life for his!

07:10.179 --> 07:11.597
That's absurd!

07:11.681 --> 07:14.517
His next attack will be deadly!

07:15.101 --> 07:16.269
Maybe so.

07:16.352 --> 07:20.940
But maybe I can signal Jotaro
before the blow kills me?

07:21.023 --> 07:23.192
I've been lucky recently.

07:23.276 --> 07:25.111
Wouldn't you say so, Emporio?

07:25.194 --> 07:28.573
I've been lucky since the jailbreak.
At least I haven't died yet!

07:28.656 --> 07:34.287
If I actually live through this,
I might even ask Jolyne to marry me!

07:37.373 --> 07:39.125
I'm just saying.

07:40.376 --> 07:41.210
That's fine by me.

07:45.089 --> 07:46.257
That's fine, Anastasia.

07:46.841 --> 07:48.301
Ask me to marry you.

07:48.926 --> 07:52.305
I'm not saying that
because I'm in despair at our situation.

07:53.306 --> 07:57.935
Your idea carries hope.
There's no darkness there.

07:58.019 --> 08:00.021
We may only have one chance.

08:00.104 --> 08:02.857
If there's even a glimpse of hope there,

08:02.940 --> 08:05.318
then I know it's the correct path for us.

08:10.615 --> 08:11.741
There he is!

08:11.824 --> 08:14.869
He's already on that rock! Emporio!

08:19.707 --> 08:21.292
Get close to me!

08:21.375 --> 08:23.252
You need to be closer!

08:25.379 --> 08:26.380
He's coming!

08:26.464 --> 08:28.132
Approaching from the right!

08:29.634 --> 08:30.843
Brace yourselves!

08:31.344 --> 08:37.266
This makes sense. The water gives him away
and tells us his position.

08:37.850 --> 08:39.477
Not yet, Jotaro.

08:39.560 --> 08:41.771
Don't stop time yet.

08:41.854 --> 08:44.190
If you miss him, it's over.

08:44.273 --> 08:46.734
You absolutely have to grab him!

08:46.817 --> 08:49.403
Feel my signal from within.

08:52.990 --> 08:55.243
Oh… wait.

08:55.326 --> 08:59.664
See that? Look at the clouds!

08:59.747 --> 09:02.416
They're zooming by like rockets!

09:02.917 --> 09:05.545
And what exactly is going on?

09:05.628 --> 09:07.505
The sky is brighter to the east!

09:09.966 --> 09:12.760
Why? It's still too early!

09:12.843 --> 09:15.721
It should take two or three minutes
for an hour to pass!

09:15.805 --> 09:19.850
That means it takes 20 to 30 minutes
for the night to pass.

09:19.934 --> 09:21.269
I don't believe this!

09:21.352 --> 09:24.188
The sun is rising
at an unbelievable speed!

09:29.026 --> 09:34.448
Time is accelerating faster than before!

09:35.408 --> 09:38.578
Around the world, birds are flying
at their normal speed.

09:39.161 --> 09:41.372
Similarly, insects and plants
haven't changed their speed.

09:41.455 --> 09:47.545
Flowers aren't blooming faster,
nor are they wilting in an instant.

09:47.628 --> 09:48.963
Look closely.

09:49.046 --> 09:51.382
I have a glass cup in my hand.

09:51.465 --> 09:55.511
When the cup is in my hand,
nothing happens to it.

09:55.595 --> 09:58.931
But the moment I let go,

10:00.141 --> 10:02.727
the cup falls faster than we can see.

10:02.810 --> 10:06.105
It's shattered on the ground
before we realize it.

10:06.188 --> 10:10.234
The only logical explanation
is the acceleration of time!

10:10.818 --> 10:15.489
Everything in the universe is
accelerating except for living things!

10:16.574 --> 10:18.618
This is all my assistants' fault!

10:18.701 --> 10:21.203
I'm the top-selling manga artist!

10:22.246 --> 10:25.291
A genius like me drawing
no more than one page a night?

10:25.374 --> 10:26.292
That's absurd!

10:29.754 --> 10:33.591
The ink dries before
I can draw a single line!

10:33.674 --> 10:35.801
What in the world am I supposed to do?

10:38.095 --> 10:39.597
Hello?

10:39.680 --> 10:42.266
What? One artist is still
meeting deadlines?

10:42.350 --> 10:44.644
Who is he?

10:44.727 --> 10:46.270
Who the hell is he?

10:46.771 --> 10:47.772
It's Rohan Kishibe.

10:47.855 --> 10:49.148
What?

10:50.900 --> 10:53.319
I can't see the waves
because of the accelerated time!

10:53.402 --> 10:55.988
We can't tell where he is!

10:56.072 --> 10:58.616
Where will he ambush us from?

11:01.077 --> 11:02.870
Get ready!

11:02.953 --> 11:04.955
Stone Ocean!

11:05.039 --> 11:06.916
Smack!

11:06.999 --> 11:10.628
Jotaro, hold off on your ability.

11:10.711 --> 11:12.380
Wait for my signal!

11:18.969 --> 11:20.346
Now! Stop the time--

11:20.429 --> 11:22.723
Star Platinum: The World!

11:27.395 --> 11:29.146
You're mine!

11:29.230 --> 11:30.648
Meet your end, Pucchi--

11:35.945 --> 11:37.321
How is this possible?

11:37.405 --> 11:40.991
Pucchi made Jolyne's Stand
attack Anastasia!

11:41.075 --> 11:43.202
I'm one step behind!

11:47.289 --> 11:48.541
Four seconds left.

11:49.250 --> 11:51.710
If I don't kill him now,

11:51.794 --> 11:54.380
he'll vanish
in the accelerated time again.

11:54.880 --> 11:57.550
It'll be over if time starts again!

11:58.134 --> 12:01.512
I must end this fight
before time restarts!

12:02.096 --> 12:03.472
Three seconds left.

12:04.181 --> 12:05.641
Two seconds!

12:22.783 --> 12:24.827
Knives, suspended in air!

12:25.327 --> 12:29.957
The priest had already thrown the knives,
just as Dio once did!

12:43.262 --> 12:45.931
You were two steps behind.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.980
STAND NAME: MAIDEN HEAVEN
STAND MASTER: ENRICO PUCCHI

13:00.529 --> 13:04.366
The Joestar family,
through their bloodline,

13:04.450 --> 13:09.580
have seized victories by
drawing strength from honor and courage.

13:10.331 --> 13:11.373
However!

13:11.457 --> 13:14.210
Your bloodline is also your weakness.

13:14.793 --> 13:19.173
Jotaro Kujo,
your weakness is your daughter.

13:37.566 --> 13:39.318
Dad…

13:40.361 --> 13:42.029
Jolyne…

13:43.531 --> 13:45.699
I stole a car…

13:45.783 --> 13:48.452
on the way home from school…

13:49.537 --> 13:52.289
at a supermarket parking lot…

13:52.873 --> 13:57.086
I stole a car… Why did I do that?

13:59.171 --> 14:03.175
But… I knew that you'd come and save me.

14:03.842 --> 14:10.140
You'd do whatever it takes… to save me…

14:10.683 --> 14:12.351
Dad, you…

14:27.908 --> 14:31.954
I must bring all loose ends to a close.

14:32.037 --> 14:37.042
I do not feel remorse,
nor can I let you run freely.

14:37.126 --> 14:39.128
I must settle every matter.

14:39.211 --> 14:42.965
After all, I am the one
who killed your mother.

14:43.048 --> 14:44.091
Emporio.

14:52.266 --> 14:53.684
Yes, shoot.

14:54.351 --> 14:57.813
At least you may die a martyr's death.

15:00.774 --> 15:04.612
Your fate ends here, Emporio!

15:20.085 --> 15:21.712
Jolyne Kujo!

15:24.715 --> 15:26.550
Ah!

15:31.513 --> 15:34.516
Joestar!

15:36.393 --> 15:38.520
Do you think you can escape me?

15:38.604 --> 15:42.775
You swim even slower than you run.

15:50.157 --> 15:51.492
Jolyne!

15:51.575 --> 15:54.328
I caught a dolphin with Stone Ocean.

15:54.828 --> 16:00.125
Yes, time may be accelerating,
but living things are unaffected.

16:00.209 --> 16:03.629
Now, Father Pucchi…
you're against this speed!

16:03.712 --> 16:06.548
How long will it take for you to catch up?

16:06.632 --> 16:08.550
The distance is at play here.

16:08.634 --> 16:10.386
Had we been closer,
you may have been able to catch up.

16:10.469 --> 16:14.306
But how far can you swim?

16:14.390 --> 16:17.476
Is it 500 meters, or 800?

16:17.559 --> 16:19.478
Can you stay underwater

16:19.561 --> 16:22.690
and swim longer than a dolphin
without letting out?

16:22.773 --> 16:24.692
Time acceleration doesn't affect

16:24.775 --> 16:29.321
the distance you can swim,
or the stamina that you have!

16:29.405 --> 16:33.575
Moreover, can you swim this distance
back to shore without drowning?

16:34.451 --> 16:36.495
You will not escape!

16:36.578 --> 16:38.747
I shall end your life!

16:39.581 --> 16:42.543
I refuse to carry this feud
into the future!

16:43.168 --> 16:44.878
Jolyne, the rope!

16:44.962 --> 16:46.797
Hurry, come to the dolphin!

16:47.881 --> 16:49.091
Emporio…

16:49.591 --> 16:53.345
Because Anastasia sacrificed himself
to protect my father,

16:53.429 --> 16:56.223
I'm still alive, though barely.

16:57.558 --> 17:00.394
Because Ermes gave her life
to attack the priest,

17:00.477 --> 17:03.772
I had enough time
to grab onto the dolphin.

17:04.356 --> 17:06.442
When a dolphin lets a human ride
on its back,

17:06.525 --> 17:09.153
it swims to shore
in the safest way possible.

17:09.236 --> 17:10.821
Hurry, please!

17:10.904 --> 17:12.322
Come!

17:12.406 --> 17:14.867
Why is the rope getting longer?

17:15.451 --> 17:20.581
That dolphin will take you to safety.
I know it will.

17:21.832 --> 17:25.544
What are you saying? Hurry and join me!

17:25.627 --> 17:28.255
Emporio, I can't join you.

17:28.756 --> 17:32.259
The priest can sense the Joestar in me.

17:32.342 --> 17:37.347
No matter where I go, I sense him,
and he senses me to track me down.

17:39.683 --> 17:42.102
If I'm with you, you can't get away.

17:44.188 --> 17:49.151
Emporio, you have to face
the path that lies ahead alone.

17:49.943 --> 17:51.361
But don't worry.

17:51.445 --> 17:53.739
I know you can finish
what we set out to do.

17:54.323 --> 17:58.452
Those who wished for your escape
were Anastasia, Ermes,

17:58.535 --> 18:02.623
and my father, Jotaro Kujo.

18:03.874 --> 18:06.710
You have to survive. You are our hope.

18:06.794 --> 18:09.797
I told you, I don't understand!

18:09.880 --> 18:11.715
No, you can't…

18:12.341 --> 18:15.219
Stop, wait! Jolyne!

18:15.302 --> 18:17.262
No!

18:17.346 --> 18:20.724
Pull the rope!

18:23.352 --> 18:24.603
He ought to be tired out by now.

18:25.395 --> 18:27.189
I'll hold him off!

18:32.194 --> 18:34.363
Face me, Father Pucchi!

18:37.407 --> 18:39.535
Stone Ocean!

18:47.126 --> 18:51.380
Jolyne!

18:51.880 --> 18:53.924
What's that in the sky?

18:54.007 --> 18:55.425
Could that be the sun?

18:55.509 --> 18:58.303
It's already morning!

18:58.387 --> 19:02.808
The sun isn't round.
It looks like it's stretching out!

19:03.392 --> 19:05.185
The needles on my watch vanished…

19:05.269 --> 19:09.565
No, it's ticking so fast,
I can't see them with my eyes!

19:10.149 --> 19:11.525
It's night time again.

19:11.608 --> 19:12.901
Morning!

19:12.985 --> 19:14.111
It's night again!

19:14.194 --> 19:15.362
What's happening?

19:15.445 --> 19:16.280
It's accelerating.

19:16.363 --> 19:19.283
Time is accelerating even more!

19:20.742 --> 19:22.536
Oh, damn!

19:23.162 --> 19:24.329
We need canned foods!

19:24.413 --> 19:26.582
Raw foods are rotting away.

19:26.665 --> 19:29.543
Hoard whatever canned food you can find!

19:29.626 --> 19:31.461
We're running out of food!

19:31.545 --> 19:35.507
Dust is collecting!
The window frames are rusting!

19:51.106 --> 19:52.482
My implants!

19:52.566 --> 19:56.195
I just got these done the other day!

19:58.739 --> 20:01.074
What is happening to the sky?

20:01.158 --> 20:03.160
Where's the sun?

20:03.243 --> 20:05.871
Is that gleaming light the sun?

20:05.954 --> 20:09.166
Is it night, or is it day?
What year are we in?

20:09.249 --> 20:11.543
What is today's date?

20:11.627 --> 20:13.503
I feel cold.

20:14.046 --> 20:15.839
The seasons are changing!

20:19.218 --> 20:21.303
What is that?

20:21.386 --> 20:23.639
The waves are eroding the rocks away!

20:24.806 --> 20:27.142
Is there no way to stop
time from accelerating?

20:27.226 --> 20:28.560
How much more?

20:28.644 --> 20:31.146
Is there an end to this?

20:45.702 --> 20:48.330
The land formation changed!

20:55.545 --> 20:57.673
Where am I?

20:57.756 --> 21:00.384
There are only live organisms here!

21:08.809 --> 21:10.560
I can't breathe…

21:35.127 --> 21:40.549
What the hell? Why are you naked here?

21:40.632 --> 21:42.426
Huh? But I was just…

21:43.260 --> 21:44.636
Hurry up!

21:44.720 --> 21:46.722
Put your jumpsuits on!

21:46.805 --> 21:48.974
Why don't I have clothes on?

21:49.057 --> 21:53.186
Wait… what was I doing?
Time got faster and I…

21:53.270 --> 21:55.230
Crap! I'm on camera!

21:55.314 --> 21:56.440
It's going to get misunderstood!

21:58.275 --> 22:00.193
This is…

22:01.528 --> 22:02.571
This place…

22:04.072 --> 22:06.825
I know where this is!

22:08.577 --> 22:11.163
This is Green Dolphin Street Prison!

22:11.246 --> 22:14.958
This is the hallway
by the visitation room!

23:41.128 --> 23:46.133
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
